# The article list of a feed: unread articles with the blue dot and a bright title, read ones grey without a dot, the age
# under the title and "saved" in the accent for a saved one; the options by a 3 s hold or Ctrl+O: Mark as read / unread,
# Mark all read, Refresh this feed, Article info.
seed pin us-ars-technica
seed refresh
seed read us-ars-technica 4
seed save us-ars-technica 1
seed refresh_on_open off
wait 900
key enter
wait 400
key enter
wait 800
expect state page articles
expect state arts 12
expect text "8 unread  ·  12 articles"
shot 01-articles
check articles
hold "^Your phone charger" 3400
wait 400
expect state popup menu
expect text "Mark as read"
shot 02-options
check article-options
tap "Mark as read"
wait 400
expect text "7 unread  ·  12 articles"
shot 03-marked-read
key ctrl-o
wait 400
expect text "Mark as unread"
tap "Mark as unread"
wait 400
expect text "8 unread  ·  12 articles"
key ctrl-o
wait 400
key end
key enter
wait 400
expect state popup info
shot 04-article-info
check article-info
key enter
wait 300
key ctrl-o
wait 400
tap "Mark all read"
wait 400
expect text "All read: Ars Technica"
wait 4200
expect text "0 unread  ·  12 articles"
shot 05-all-read
key ctrl-o
wait 400
tap "Refresh this feed"
wait 1200
shot 06-refreshed
key end
wait 300
shot 07-end-of-list
key esc
wait 400
expect state page favorites
shot 08-favorites-after
